            0.537
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 1,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.189,
                0.82,
                0.229
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 有紫外吸收能力的氨基酸有____、____、____其中以____的吸收最强。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 2,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.233,
                0.82,
                0.274
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 蛋白质溶液是亲水胶体，它具有一般胶体溶液的共同性质，如____、____、____和____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.278,
                0.82,
                0.317
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 含有 ADP 成分的辅酶有____、____和____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.321,
                0.82,
                0.362
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 使酶具有高催化效率的因素是____、____、____、____和____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.366,
                0.82,
                0.405
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 脂溶性维生素包括____、____、____、____和____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.41,
                0.82,
                0.449
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6.典型的生物界普遍存在的生物氧化体系是由____、____和____三部分组成的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.453,
                0.82,
                0.493
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 糖原合成的关键酶是____，糖原分解的关键酶是____。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.498,
                0.82,
                0.537
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 甲状腺激素包括____和____两种，它们是以____和____为原料合成的。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.563,
            0.474,
            0.582
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、选择题（共10分,每题1分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.586,
            0.633,
            0.603
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 必须到饱和硫酸铵盐时才能析出的血浆蛋白为:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.608,
            0.77,
            0.626
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. α1-球蛋白 b. 清蛋白 c. 纤维蛋白原 d. γ-球蛋白 e. β-球蛋白"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.63,
            0.656,
            0.647
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 下列激素那个不是在哺乳动物脑垂体前叶合成的？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.652,
            0.819,
            0.691
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 生长激素 b. 抗利尿激素 c. 促黄体生成激素 d. 促卵泡激素 e. 催乳激素"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.696,
            0.464,
            0.713
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. 下列属于反式作用因子的是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.718,
            0.727,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 启动子 b. 增强子 c. 终止子 d. 转录因子 e. RNA 聚合酶"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.74,
            0.779,
            0.757
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. 下列既参与嘌呤核苷酸合成，又参与嘧啶核苷酸合成的物质是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.191,
            0.762,
            0.695,
            0.78
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a.谷氨酰胺 b.谷氨酸 c.甘氨酸 d.丙氨酸 e.天冬酰胺"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.784,
            0.485,
            0.801
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. 哪一种化合物不是甲基接受体:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.806,
            0.819,
            0.845
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. 胍乙酸 b. 同型半光氨酸 c. 胱氨酸 d. 去甲肾上腺素 e. 磷脂酰乙醇胺"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.85,
            0.443,
            0.867
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. 含有三个双键的脂肪酸是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.191,
            0.872,
            0.71,
            0.89
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a.油酸 b.软脂肪酸 c.亚麻酸 d.棕榈酸 e.花生四烯酸"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.894,
            0.568,
            0.911
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. 糖蛋白中蛋白质与糖分子结合的基团是:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.103,
            0.63,
            0.119
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a.-OH b.-SH c.-COOH d.-CH3 e.=CH₂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.123,
            0.639,
            0.141
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. 按公式  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Delta G'=-2.3RT\\lg K"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , 确定下列反应的自由能:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.649,
            0.146,
            0.821,
            0.161
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A + B  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\leftrightarrow"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  C"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.402,
            0.167,
            0.667,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10 mol/L 10mol/L 10mol/L"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.19,
            0.748,
            0.207
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. -9.2 RT b. -4.6RT c. -2.3RT d. +2.3RT e. +4.6RT"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.212,
            0.636,
            0.229
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. 下列哪种作用涉及的辅酶的组成成分含有泛酸？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.233,
            0.799,
            0.252
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a.脱酰基作用 b.乙酰化作用 c.脱氢作用 d.还原作用 e.氧化作用"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.255,
            0.601,
            0.273
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. 有机磷农药所结合的胆碱酯酶上的基团是:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.217,
            0.279,
            0.656,
            0.295
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a.-OH b.-COOH c.-SH d.-CH₃ e.-NH₂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.321,
            0.616,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三、判断是(√)非(×)题（每题1分，共20分）。"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 30,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.344,
            0.821,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.176,
                0.344,
                0.492,
                0.361
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1.His 是人体的一种半必需氨基酸。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.365,
                0.648,
                0.383
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. 组蛋白是一类碱性蛋白质，它含有很多的组氨酸。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.388,
                0.667,
                0.405
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 用  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "{}^{3}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": " H—胸苷嘧啶只能标记 DNA，而不能标记 RNA。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.41,
                0.711,
                0.427
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 一个核酸分子由一个磷酸，一个五碳糖和一个碱基构成。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.432,
                0.576,
                0.449
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. 维持 DNA 分子稳定的主要化学键是氢键。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.453,
                0.564,
                0.471
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. 同工酶是指催化一类化学反应的一类酶。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.176,
                0.476,
                0.408,
                0.494
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 同工酶的最适 pH 相同。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.497,
                0.749,
                0.515
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8.脂肪酶合成酶催化的反应是脂肪酸的  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\beta-"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  氧化反应的逆反应。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.519,
                0.652,
                0.537
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "9.脂肪酸合成过程中所需的[H]全部由NADPH提供。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 19,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.542,
                0.72,
                0.559
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "10.DNA 修复合成时首先合成的 DNA 短片段称为冈崎片段。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 20,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.564,
                0.747,
                0.581
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "11.DNA 复制时，领头链只需 1 个引物，随从链则需多个引物。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 21,
              "bbox": [
                0.175,
                0.585,
                0.821,
                0.625
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "12.与顺式作用元件和 RNA 聚合酶相互作用的蛋白质称为反式作用因子。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 22,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.63,
                0.664,
                0.647
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "13.原核生物一个 mRNA 分子只含一条多肽链的信息。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 23,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.652,
                0.726,
                0.669
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "14.原核生物有三种终止因子，真核生物只有一种终止因子。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 24,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.674,
                0.739,
                0.691
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "15.肽酰 tRNA 结合在核蛋白体 A 位，氨酰 tRNA 结合在 D 位。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 25,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.696,
                0.721,
                0.713
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "16.阻遏蛋白是能与操纵基因结合，从而阻碍转录的蛋白质。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 26,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.718,
                0.553,
                0.735
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "17. 胆红素自肝脏排出的形式是胆素原族。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 27,
              "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.74,
                0.553,
                0.757
              ],
              "content": [
